{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "67350acf0e30d1018b2bc311fbbe8f454a90d843830fc8b3b385d49cf69d34ce", "ja": "ライブMC　～お決まりのフレーズ～", "zh": "演唱会MC ～固定的台词～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c1afdb9a726dbc52b7cff7c0e333b0a158ba9f3c659d48caad4269b8d94e7154", "ja": "MC中、お決まりのコールで会場を沸かす杏\n奈。歩と環が後に続き、決め台詞の披露合\n戦に。順番が回ってきた雪歩は、決め台詞\nなんてないと躊躇するが、それでも期待に\n応えようと、シャウトするのだった。", "zh": "主持中，杏奈用招牌呼声点燃了全场。\n紧接着步与环也跟了上去，演变成了招牌\n台词的大比拼。轮到雪步时，她虽然犹豫\n着自己没有什么招牌台词，但为了回应大\n家的期待，还是大声呐喊了出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "3c8378c5ff5169f56e5bf9e605d07d7dd9cea64804579d3f63151dcd6d487ba9", "ja": "みんなー！　杏奈たちの歌、聞いてくれてありがとー！\nビビッと決まってたかな～！？", "zh": "大家——！谢谢大家来听杏奈她们唱歌——！\n有没有触电般的帅气呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "0a07adea3eb908222854edd0e778ebf08d6cb58143ebef441e83f3dc149c855c", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "eb96ecd3a197a9c321e48155b01cf8a8f65d81e2e03465b330e175f7b64ea487", "ja": "おお～！　あんなのきめぜりふって、\nいっつも盛り上がるよね！　カッコイイな～。", "zh": "哇～！那种必杀台词，每次都能让气氛热闹起来呢！好帅啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "af47f8259b332801f9ec9b280363371c974c794a4b0a181b90fb52b59e01a96a", "ja": "たまきも、何かきめぜりふみたいなの言ってみたいぞ！\nえっと……しゃきーん！", "zh": "环也想说点像必杀台词那样的话！\n那个……锵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "f96ddb1670d10fa757c7348dbd2e02215198368dc424bfd690cc0447a0c80daa", "ja": "しゃきーん！！", "zh": "闪亮登场！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5c4f90b2a5ed8195615f0ade1d397ea9e65ab19784968e04f600b0b677d1c9e7", "ja": "わぁっ、す、すごいですぅ！\n会場中のお客さんが、環ちゃんと同じポーズで……。", "zh": "哇，好、好厉害啊！\n整个会场的客人都摆出了和小环一样的姿势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "abf45bc5bc86ddf651d6b2f7945eb2ce7d1f1a240d47eac061ba84c04802726f", "ja": "本当だ、みんな一発で合わせてきた！？\nさすがだな～。それじゃアタシも……行くよ～！", "zh": "真的，大家一下子就摆出了同样的姿势！？\n不愧是你们啊～。那我也……要上咯～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e160b7853c0635c8aaa586b3da60331d41d0148679245b60235fb4deab3fe452", "ja": "ヘイヘイヘイヘーイ！　みんな、盛り上がってる～？\nレッツ・ダンシ～ング！！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿嘿——！大家嗨起来了吗～？\n一起跳舞吧——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3e2481750af99e6dc5c9b01548d3d5d551f6cd24c08a970a53877134a84ddef9", "ja": "サンキューッ！　うわぁ、やっぱ気持ちいいね♪\nみんな最高だよ、ありがとーっ！", "zh": "谢谢——！哇啊，果然感觉真棒♪\n大家最棒了，谢谢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "ed82d426ee3c870bbd7047768a2b7b67d87b062185ca842d8bc4bc63f4f9bff4", "ja": "歩さんも環ちゃんも、ビビッと輝いてたよ！\nそれじゃあ最後は……雪歩さんだね！　お願いします♪", "zh": "步前辈和小环都闪闪发光哦！\n那么最后就是……雪步前辈！拜托啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8cae64180a67cf7ebcaf6b249f0eaa23b0b2a1a0d0f668a05dd77aab802f8f75", "ja": "え、ええ！？　わ、私もやるの？\nでも私、そんな決め台詞なんて、何も……。", "zh": "诶、诶诶！？我、我也要来吗？\n可是我、我根本没有什么必杀台词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "dc209f899bdcbd91ed09f48ea97e6e27c2b413f5070f2458739e05bd71f16dd4", "ja": "たまき、知ってるぞ！　雪歩お姉ちゃんには、\nとっておきのがあるんだよね！", "zh": "环，环知道哦！雪步姐姐有个压箱底的，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "d1d45a8790b801c2aaec6e5b30653c27394237dc872948a4278814d195470996", "ja": "杏奈も、雪歩さんのアレ、大好きだよ！\nビビッとエンジンかかっちゃう感じがして♪", "zh": "杏奈也最喜欢雪步小姐的那个了！\n感觉一下子就能让人干劲十足♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "51fdc3c0f0be470fca8ef2c61b089043a4c858be8cfe28eb234f789328672929", "ja": "あはは。だってさ、雪歩！\nここまで言われたら、やるしかないよね？", "zh": "啊哈哈。听到大家这么说了哦，雪步！\n都说到这个份上了，只能上了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c19efcae3b7b8aee8b29304b5a6c98e93acdf35f673d890e9f091100711f4494", "ja": "歩ちゃん……うう、わ、わかりましたぁ！\n私なりに、がんばってみるね……すぅ……。", "zh": "步……呜呜，我、我明白了！我会按自己的方式努力试试的……吸——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0fd9e1e99947644fea5a8be0bca76185202d3f13e3b10eccc16c4d26b50ea1ab", "ja": "み、みんなー！　まだまだ全開でいくよー！\nいえええぇぇいっ！！", "zh": "大、大家——！接下来还要全力以赴哦——！\n耶——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_07_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "c7e75187c8dc1c1cef9603f047dd8df3b0002f856b53b35366b3fa080ccfc38e", "ja": "いえぇぇぇい！", "zh": "耶～～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
